#   .92 optiplex9020  .94 homelab (this host)  .95 mitx  .100 inspiron14
#   .102 yoga213  .103 xps13  .105 aspiree17
#
# Addresses must be DHCP reservations. A changed address breaks every
# NFS-backed pod on that node. Update all three lines below plus
# docs/DEVELOPMENT.md, then run: sudo exportfs -ra

